C"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1157688559207544", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_1157688562540877_5487867679010919630_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3D8Gj_wlqtAQ7kNvwEMMtji&_nc_oc=AdpL9-0m0yKQM2mNFaKbhnIGSoonEVloBzC62zEw5MVUHpkZrUHkUifglQDT7NEE-XM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM8Kdpag8wXcYC3uoPrAsgYxN942mHpD--13Enhj9mc9w&oe=6ACBB245"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1088296552750042", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75348041_1088296556083375_5090998954574073554_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oPwRVHIlCscQ7kNvwGPzT2B&_nc_oc=Adqxv3tIz4GniqDw35qxWEBiIASjXejdyU9zK2_d6UR9PThowArGB0Ocywl6Wg6TMLk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPb8__TSOrlVfaJFYjUR3w7C5Bi1TSy2NFC6fYmfhzJsQ&oe=6ACBAC14"}, "display_name": "escape-from-x", "keywords": ["survival", "action", "military", "FPS"], "long_description": "Dive into Escape-from-X, where survival takes center stage in an immersive VR experience. Navigate a world where medicine, food, and hydration are crucial to your journey. From the early stages as a novice (\"Mladshi\") to becoming a top survival expert, every decision you make impacts your success. Your VR tablet acts as a real-world companion, helping you assist hideout NPCs and unravel the game's secrets. Inspired by the beloved Escape from Tarkov, Escape-from-X pushes the boundaries of VR UX with intuitive and groundbreaking features.", "short_description": "Experience immersive survival in Escape-from-X. Manage medicine, food, and hydration while making critical decisions as you progress from a novice to a skilled survival expert. Use your VR tablet as a real-world companion to aid NPCs and uncover the story. Inspired by Escape from Tarkov, this game redefines VR UX."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://badjoe